        rdfs:comment "The caller account empirical profile, excluding every seeded corpus. Actual episode counts and eligibility are exposed; caller-supplied evidence stays Hypothetical regardless count and cannot trigger automatic rate-based swaps." ;
        hydra:supportedProperty
