    rdfs:comment "Takes the output of foxxi.cohort_concept_intelligence and derives a fxa:AdaptiveSequencingPolicy document naming the concepts a cohort is struggling with and the reinforcement each suggests. NOT ENFORCED: nothing currently consumes it — foxxi.launch_au_with_prereq_check returns the same decision with and without a policy supplied, verified by direct comparison. Treat the output as analysis to act on, not as a gate that acts on your behalf." ;
